      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Color channels map to system states: Emerald = Growth/Buy (upward momentum, active profit, positive sentiment); Crimson = Risk/Sell (downward pressure, stop-loss warnings, sell signals); Amber = Caution (connectivity alerts, extreme volatility warnings, shadow-mode deviation anomalies); Telemetry Cyan = live values, active telemetry, focus indicators."
    },
